# Meeting the living figures (city life): Socrates in the Agora on the Panathenaia, found among
# the crowd and the procession; his card opens while he moves (titled in Greek), F follows him,
# Esc, a drag or Home lets go; the journal keeps him and the procession witnessed.
set season summer
set day 10
set time 0.125
set world agora 1
wait 60
set look athens.socrates 2
wait 120
move life:athens.socrates
wait 3
expect tip Σωκράτης
click life:athens.socrates
wait 10
expect info Σωκράτης
key f
wait 5
expect following yes
wait 180
expect city moving
shot shots/city_meet_follow.png
key escape
wait 5
expect following no
expect info Σωκράτης
# A drag with the mouse lets go too, and so does Home (L-114).
key f
wait 5
expect following yes
drag 300,400 520,520
wait 30
expect following no
key f
wait 5
expect following yes
key home
wait 5
expect following no
key escape
wait 5
expect info no
expect found athens 2
quit
